# Hammer BC01 (and BC01 Pro) board configuration.
#
# Applied as a fragment on top of the base sdkconfig, so it carries only what
# differs between boards. Build with tools/build_board.py bc01.
#
# The UART pins are the entire reason this file exists. The Kconfig defaults
# in components/bc_hal are 17/18, which is the BC04 arrangement; the BC01 has
# them the other way round. Verified on hardware -- with the pins crossed the
# miner boots, serves its interface, detects the chip and never returns a
# single share, which looks exactly like broken hardware.
CONFIG_DEVICE_MODULE="BC01"
CONFIG_GPIO_UART_CHAIN_0_TXD0=18
CONFIG_GPIO_UART_CHAIN_0_RXD0=17
